## 12. Architecture — proposal, for the Sep 23 session

"One state, one clock, many small rules."

```
sim.js          pure circuit eval. Never knows dating exists.
store           { gates, wires, mode, flags, bubbles, effects }
clock           one 1s tick. Runs rules only in Date mode.
rules/          one file per rule, same signature:
                  (world, now) → actions[]
                  decay · spawn · attach · pairing · autoflip
reducer         addGate, addWire, removeGate, say(bubble), effect(hurt, ms), setMode
content/*.json  lines · reactions · propaganda · dialogue
theme           <html data-mode="logic|date"> → CSS tokens swap
layout          same components, different CSS grid areas per mode;
                canvas stays mounted across the flip
```

- New behavior = one file in `rules/`. Remove = one line.
- New joke = one JSON line. Teammates can own content → real commits for the activity log.
- New look = tokens. Components never ask which mode they are in.

